# Mercury Worker — every value the Worker needs that is not in wrangler.toml.
#
#   cp worker/.dev.vars.example worker/.dev.vars
#   $EDITOR worker/.dev.vars          # replace each <...> with the real value
#   scripts/push_worker_secrets.sh    # uploads them to Cloudflare
#
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored, and it is also the file `wrangler dev` reads,
# so one filled-in copy serves local development and production both.
#
# Lines left at their <placeholder> are SKIPPED by the push script, on
# purpose: a present-but-wrong credential answers 401 from GitHub at 03:40
# with nobody awake to read it. Absent beats plausible-and-wrong.
#
# But "absent" is not equally loud for all four. MERCURY_API_TOKEN and
# GITHUB_DISPATCH_TOKEN each get a 503 naming the variable; ELEVENLABS_API_KEY
# is a supported absence; USER_TIMEZONE fails SILENTLY, falling back to UTC so
# the phone asks for the wrong day. Fill that one in.

# The shared bearer token. Same value as backend/.env and as
# ios/Mercury/Secrets.xcconfig. At least 32 characters — the Worker refuses
# to serve with a shorter one rather than pretending to be protected.
# Generate: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
MERCURY_API_TOKEN=<same token the backend and the phone use>

# IANA zone, e.g. Europe/Lisbon. NOT optional. /health reports it and the
# iOS client caches it to derive briefing ids for its background prefetch,
# so leaving it unset makes the phone ask for the wrong day all winter.
USER_TIMEZONE=<IANA zone, e.g. Europe/Lisbon>

# Fine-grained GitHub PAT for udujoel/mercury with Actions: Read and write.
# This is what lets the Worker say "run the workflow now" — without it the
# rebuild button 503s AND the 03:40 cron cannot generate anything.
# Minting it: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, "The dispatch token". It expires; write
# the date down, because nothing here will remind you.
GITHUB_DISPATCH_TOKEN=<fine-grained PAT, starts with github_pat_>

# Optional. Only /voices uses it, to list the voices the picker offers.
# Absent is a supported state: /voices returns an empty list with 200 and
# the picker falls back to plain text fields.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=<ElevenLabs API key, or leave as-is to skip the picker>
